{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"迹猜想"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"迹猜想"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"自守层","text":"自守层"}},{"Plain":"范畴上 Frobenius 的迹等同于"},{"Local":{"url":"自守函数","text":"自守函数"}},{"Plain":"的空间.\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Tr}(\\mathrm{Frob}_*,\\mathsf{Shv}_{\\mathrm{Nilp}}(\\mathrm{Bun}_G)) \\simeq \\operatorname{Func}_{\\mathrm{c}}(\\mathrm{Bun}_G (\\mathbb F_q)).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}